		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Elite soldier altered into sentient, shapeshifting ooze via ancient, lost alchemy. Nigh-immortal, inscrutable.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 morphic weapon (close/far) +6 (1d12), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Morphic Body</strong>. As an action, can assume any humanoid form or form limbs into melee or ranged morphic weapons.</p><p></p><p><strong>Nigh-Immortal</strong>. If reduced to 0 HP, melts into watery ooze and flows into the earth, reforming over several years.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
